WEBVTT

00:03:29.897 --> 00:03:32.497
There's a musical flow
and a timing to predict

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.630
in your opponent's actions and reactions.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:37.097
And crucially, just like piano,

00:03:37.097 --> 00:03:40.563
top esports pros hit
dozens of keys at once.

00:03:40.597 --> 00:03:43.897
Gamers regularly achieve APMs,
or actions per minute,

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:46.163
of 300 or more,

00:03:46.197 --> 00:03:49.563
which is roughly one command
every fifth of a second

00:03:49.597 --> 00:03:52.297
and in particularly mechanically
demanding esports,

00:03:52.297 --> 00:03:53.597
like StarCraft,

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:57.097
top pros achieve
APMs of 600 or more,

00:03:57.097 --> 00:04:01.763
allowing them to literally control
entire armies one unit at a time.